name: EQUIP_SET_NAME_BOSS_ACCESSORY
# Nine slots, all of them filled since Pink Bean, so every tier pays. Some of
# them name two items apiece: a later boss drops an alternate for a slot an
# earlier one already filled, and either piece fills the slot.
